  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Plains clanhold, ascending. Nantan (Apache, band headman) barony; Tekwuniwap (Comanche war chief) march; Paraibo (Comanche band peace-chief) county; Akicita-paraibo (warrior-society headman) duchy; Pia-Paraibo (great chief over several bands) principality; Tabe-Naika (head-chief of the confederation's council) kingdom; Pia-Tabe-Naika (grand head-chief) empire. The chiefs' council and the warrior-societies check the chiefs; a nomad confederation rarely holds past the head-chief. (Rank titles draw on the real Plains register, allowed.)",
